    "chunk_text": "on bigspellum cwe\u00feende, So\u00felice uteode se s\u00e6dere hys s\u00e6d to sawenne. & \u00fea \u00fea he seow sume hig feollon wi\u00fe weg & fuglas comun & \u00e6ton \u00fea. So\u00felice sume feollon on st\u00e6nihte \u00fe\u00e6r hyt n\u00e6fde mycle eor\u00fean & hr\u00e6dlice upsprungon for\u00feam \u00fee hig So\u00felice upsprungenre sunnan hig adruwudon & forscruncon for \u00feam \u00fee hig n\u00e6fdon wyrtrum. So\u00felice sume feollon on \u00feornas & \u00fea \u00feornas weoxon & for\u00ferysmudon \u00fea. Sume so\u00felice feollon on gode eor\u00fean & sealdon weastm, sum hundfealdne, sum sixtigfealdne, sum Se \u00fee h\u00e6bbe earan to gehyrenne gehyre. & \u00fea geneal\u00e6hton his leorningcnihtas & cw\u00e6don to hym, for hwig spycst \u00feu to hym mid \u00d0a andswarode he hym, for\u00feam \u00fee eow is geseald to witanne heofena rices gerynu & him nys na So\u00felice \u00feam \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00fe him by\u00fe geseald & he h\u00e6f\u00f0, so\u00felice se \u00fee n\u00e6f\u00f0 & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee he h\u00e6f\u00f0 him bi\u00f0 For\u00f0am ic spece to him mid bigspellum for\u00feam \u00fee lociende hig ne geseo\u00fe & gehyrende hig ne \u00de\u00e6t on him si gefylled Esaias witegung, Of gehyrnysse ge gehyra\u00fe & ge ne ongyta\u00fe, & lociende ge So\u00felice \u00feises folces heorte is ahyrd & hig hefelice mid earum gehyrdon & hyra eagan beclysdon \u00fee So\u00felice eadige synt eowre eagan for\u00feam \u00fe",
